+# Bitmask: 0x1 core, 0x2 batched leaf-PTE aging (page-table walks), 0x4 non-leaf.
+# 7 = kernel default. Clearing 0x2 forces rmap-based aging, whose cost scales
+# with the game's mapped address space and therefore grows over a session.
